```

Applies to:  SQL Server  Azure SQL Database  Azure SQL Managed Instance  Azure
Synapse Analytics  Analytics Platform System (PDW)  SQL analytics endpoint in Microsoft
Fabric  Warehouse in Microsoft Fabric  SQL database in Microsoft Fabric
Grants permissions on a table, view, table-valued function, stored procedure, extended stored
procedure, scalar function, aggregate function, service queue, or synonym.
 Transact-SQL syntax conventions
syntaxsql
Specifies a permission that can be granted on a schema-contained object. For a list of the
permissions, see Remarks.
Syntax
```sql
GRANT <permission> [ ,...n ] ON
