    '### VIEW DEFINITION CONTROL VIEW DEFINITION

The grantor (or the principal specified with the AS option) must have either the permission
itself with GRANT OPTION, or a higher permission that implies the permission being granted.
If using the AS option, these additional requirements apply.
AS granting_principal Additional permission required
Database user IMPERSONATE permission on the user, membership in the
db_securityadmin fixed database role, membership in the db_owner fixed
database role, or membership in the sysadmin fixed server role.
