    '### GRANT OPTION FOR

Indicates that the right to grant the specified permission to other principals will be revoked. The
permission itself will not be revoked.
permission
Is the name of a permission. The valid mappings of permissions to securables are described in the
"Remarks" section, later in this topic.
Syntax

