VALUES (
    'chunk_1946d93eff9a',
    'converted_sql-sql-server-ver17.md',
    56053,
    '### GRANT OPTION FOR

Indicates that the right to grant the specified right to other principals will be revoked. The
permission itself will not be revoked.
ON SCHEMA :: schema*_name*
Specifies the schema on which the permission is being revoked. The scope qualifier :: is required.
database_principal
Specifies the principal from which the permission is being revoked. One of the following:
Syntax

REVOKE [ GRANT OPTION FOR ] permission  [ ,...n ]
    ON SCHEMA :: schema_name
    { TO | FROM } database_principal [ ,...n ]',
