    56131,
    '### GO

B. Revoking the WITH GRANT option



The login still has CONNECT SQL permission, but it can no longer grant that permission to other
principals.
```sql
GRANT (Transact-SQL)
```

DENY (Transact-SQL)
DENY Server Permissions (Transact-SQL)
REVOKE Server Permissions (Transact-SQL)
Permissions Hierarchy (Database Engine)
sys.fn_builtin_permissions (Transact-SQL)
sys.fn_my_permissions (Transact-SQL)
HAS_PERMS_BY_NAME (Transact-SQL)
Last updated on 07/01/2026
USE master;
REVOKE GRANT OPTION FOR CONNECT SQL FROM JanethEsteves;',
