    56144,
    '### GO

B. Revoking VIEW DEFINITION permission with CASCADE



The following example revokes VIEW DEFINITION  permission on the SQL Server login
EricKurjan  from the SQL Server login RMeyyappan . The CASCADE  option indicates that VIEW
DEFINITION  permission on EricKurjan  will also be revoked from the principals to which
RMeyyappan  granted this permission.',
