    56150,
    '### GRANT OPTION FOR

Indicates that the right to grant the specified right to other principals will be revoked. The
permission itself will not be revokes.
permission
Specifies a permission that can be revoked on a Service Broker securable. For a list of these
permissions, see the Remarks section later in this topic.
Syntax

REVOKE [ GRANT OPTION FOR ] permission [ ,...n ] ON
    {
       [ CONTRACT :: contract_name ]
       | [ MESSAGE TYPE :: message_type_name ]
       | [ REMOTE SERVICE BINDING :: remote_binding_name ]
       | [ ROUTE :: route_name ]
       | [ SERVICE :: service_name ]
        }
    { TO | FROM } database_principal [ ,...n ]',
