    '### VIEW DEFINITION CONTROL VIEW DEFINITION

Requires CONTROL permission on the symmetric key or ALTER ANY SYMMETRIC KEY permission
on the database. If you use the AS option, the specified principal must own the symmetric key.
The following example revokes ALTER  permission on the symmetric key SamInventory42  from the
user HamidS  and from other principals to which HamidS  has granted ALTER  permission.',
