    '### VIEW DEFINITION CONTROL VIEW DEFINITION

Requires CONTROL permission on the XML schema collection. If you use the AS option, the
specified principal must own the XML schema collection.
Remarks
ﾉ Expand table
Permissions



The following example revokes EXECUTE  permission on the XML schema collection Invoices4
from the user Wanida . The XML schema collection Invoices4  is located inside the Sales  schema
of the AdventureWorks2025  database.',
