VALUES (
    'chunk_de48855478fb',
    'converted_sql-sql-server-ver17.md',
    56242,
    '### DECLARE

    @dialog_handle UNIQUEIDENTIFIER,



The following example ends the dialog specified by @dialog_handle . SQL Server immediately
removes all messages from the service queue and the transmission queue, without notifying
the remote service. Since ending a dialog with cleanup does not notify the remote service, you
should only use this in cases where the remote service is not available to receive an EndDialog
or Error message.',
