    '### WAITFOR (

    GET CONVERSATION GROUP @conversation_group_id



The following example sets @conversation_group_id  to the conversation group identifier for
the next available message on ExpenseQueue . If no message is available, GET CONVERSATION
GROUP  returns immediately without changing @conversation_group_id .',
