group from the ExpenseQueue  queue. The statement returns the messages as a result set that
Permissions
Examples
A. Receive all columns for all messages in a conversation
group
RECEIVE * FROM ExpenseQueue ;
B. Receive specified columns for all messages in a
conversation group



