    '### ７ Note

When you set the READ_COMMITTED_SNAPSHOT  option, only the connection executing the ALTER
DATABASE  command is allowed in the database. There must be no other open connection in
the database until ALTER DATABASE  is complete. The database doesn''t have to be in single-
user mode.',
