    57185,
    '### XML

Attribute node order is enforced during serialization rather than during static type
checking. For example, the following query fails because it attempts to add an attribute
<a attr="Item5" />
DECLARE @x AS XML;
SET @x = ''<x>5</x>'';
```sql
SELECT @x.query(''<a attr="{/x}{/x}"/>'');
```

DECLARE @x AS XML;
SET @x = ''<x>5</x>'';
```sql
SELECT @x.query(''<a attr="{''''Item'''', /x }" />'');
SELECT @x.query(''<a attr="{''''Item'''', data(/x)}"/>'');
```

<a attr="Item 5" />



after a non-attribute node.',
