    57299,
    '### XML

The following query retrieves the same information, but only for those product models whose
catalog description includes the weight, the <Weight>  element, in the specifications, the
<Specifications>  element. This example uses WITH XMLNAMESPACES  to declare the pd  prefix and
its namespace binding. In this way, the binding isn''t described in both the query()  method and
in the exist()  method.',
