    '### XML

Note the following considerations from the previous query:
In the WHERE  clause, the exist()  method is used to retrieve only rows that have product
catalog descriptions with the <Picture>  element.
The WHERE  clause uses the value()  method two times to compare the values of the
<Size>  and <Angle>  elements.
Here''s a partial result:',
