VALUES (
    'chunk_2ae915d83fb0',
    'converted_sql-sql-server-ver17.md',
    57311,
    '### XML

WITH XMLNAMESPACES (''https://schemas.microsoft.com/sqlserver/2004/07/adventure-
works/ProductModelDescription'' AS pd)
```sql
SELECT ProductModelID,
```

       CatalogDescription.query(''
          <Prod >
             { /pd:ProductDescription/@ProductModelID }
             { /pd:ProductDescription/pd:Summary }
          </Prod>
 '') AS Result
FROM Production.ProductModel
WHERE CatalogDescription.value(''
     contains( string( (/pd:ProductDescription/pd:Summary)[1] ),"Aerodynamic")'',
''bit'') = 1;
ProductModelID Result
-------------- ------------------------------------------
28     <Prod ProductModelID="28">
        <pd:Summary
xmlns:pd="https://schemas.microsoft.com/sqlserver/2004/07/adventure-
works/ProductModelDescription">
       <p1:p xmlns:p1="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
         A TRUE multi-sport bike that offers streamlined riding and a
         revolutionary design. Aerodynamic design lets you ride with the
         pros, and the gearing will conquer hilly roads.</p1:p>
       </pd:Summary>
      </Prod>



The following query retrieves ProductModelIDs for product models whose catalog descriptions
do no include a <Picture>  element.',
